{"id":7894,"date":"2021-09-28T16:21:29","date_gmt":"2021-09-28T20:21:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7894"},"modified":"2021-10-01T08:59:11","modified_gmt":"2021-10-01T12:59:11","slug":"just-a-little-burp-with-the-car-and-the-computer","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/09\/28\/just-a-little-burp-with-the-car-and-the-computer\/","title":{"rendered":"Just a Little Burp With The Car (and the computer)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>While we were in Montana we took the opportunity to drive over to the far west end of Fort Peck Reservoir to see if we could spot (and or hear) the male elk bugling.  This is the time of year for mating and Ranger Sue told us there was a pretty big herd over that way.  The lake is 135 miles long and we were camping at the far east end while the elk herd was spotted at the far west end.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FortPeckLake.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"328\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FortPeckLake.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7906\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FortPeckLake.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FortPeckLake-300x129.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FortPeckLake-685x296.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Lake has 1500 miles of shoreline and is over 135 miles from east to west<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>During our ride, the exhaust system on the car blew out and it was LOUD!  I think we scared all the elk into hiding.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I knew there was no place near Fort Peck to get it fixed and that it would be best until we made it down to Rapid City next week.  We would be towing it more than driving it over the next few days so we were good with that plan.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I looked online and found Chad and Exhaust Pros in Rapid City.  He had loads of good reviews.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We pulled the coach in his drive (towing the car) and Chad came right out, crawled under the car, and assured me it was an easy fix.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>He told me to unhook the car, he&#8217;d pull it into the hoist, and he&#8217;d have us out of there in an hour.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Turns out it was a flexible coupling that connects the manifold to the exhaust pipe that failed and Chad quickly cut out the old one and welded in the new one.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>What impressed me about Exhaust Pros is that exhaust work is the ONLY work they do.  Unlike the national chains that advertise &#8220;Exhaust\/Brakes\/Alignment&#8221; and may or may not have the right part for your vehicle, Chad carries all the commonly needed exhaust parts and BENDS HIS OWN PIPE, he doesn&#8217;t have to order a bunch of different pipes for a myriad of car models.  Bending his own pipe means that he can effect a repair much more quickly not having to rely on Napa or AutoZone or another supplier to bring him the needed pipe.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1056332914070136077179787168.jpg\" data-id=\"7901\" class=\"wp-image-7901\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1056332914070136077179787168.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1056332914070136077179787168-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1056332914070136077179787168-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1056487001503247771580173983.jpg\" data-id=\"7898\" class=\"wp-image-7898\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1056487001503247771580173983.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1056487001503247771580173983-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1056487001503247771580173983-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">We waited in our coach<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1057060075002257929269582336.jpg\" data-id=\"7897\" class=\"wp-image-7897\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1057060075002257929269582336.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1057060075002257929269582336-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1057060075002257929269582336-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_11051170075050049413749021.jpg\" data-id=\"7899\" class=\"wp-image-7899\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_11051170075050049413749021.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_11051170075050049413749021-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_11051170075050049413749021-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The new coupling ready to be welded<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1104368868921563109371973133.jpg\" data-id=\"7903\" class=\"wp-image-7903\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1104368868921563109371973133.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1104368868921563109371973133-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1104368868921563109371973133-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1109376763301354099268955340.jpg\" data-id=\"7900\" class=\"wp-image-7900\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1109376763301354099268955340.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1109376763301354099268955340-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_1109376763301354099268955340-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Chad welding the pipe<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_111119505177449443516041258.jpg\" data-id=\"7902\" class=\"wp-image-7902\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_111119505177449443516041258.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_111119505177449443516041258-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/img_20210914_111119505177449443516041258-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Exhaust Pros shop in Rapid City, South Dakota<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"720\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1280 \/ 720;\" width=\"1280\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/wp-1632860364589.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>(Video) Chad welding in the new coupling<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>He got the car down off the hoist and started it up.  The noise was a LOT BETTER, but still there was a problem.  Back down on the ground to take a look, Chad found that both of the mufflers are rusted and have very small pinhole leaks in them.  It was up to me whether to just go ahead and drive it or have more work done.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We decided to go ahead and have two new mufflers installed but that would have to be done another day as it would take him more time to get it done and he&#8217;d need to get back to serving his customers who have appointments set up.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We reached out to our friends David and Sue who are working at Custer State Park.  We were planning on getting together with them anyway to discuss our travel plans back to Rover&#8217;s Roost in Arizona.  The four of us will travel together once they are done with their Custer gig October 1st.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It turned out that they had Thursday off work so we set a date for them to pick us up at the muffler shop on Thursday and we&#8217;d have lunch together and talk about our travel plans while the repair is being completed.  I LOVE IT WHEN A PLAN COMES TOGETHER!  (Thank you David and Sue!)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We got back to the shop in time to pick up the car and Kathy and I made a bee-line for Best Buy where I had to buy a new computer as my 15 year-old Dell laptop finally gave up the ghost.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We got the computer and we back on the road to Hot Springs before 3:30<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Next blog post &#8211; Hot Springs South Dakota and Angostura Recreation Area (and see who we bumped into there!)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for riding along and we welcome your comments below.  See you next time!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Herb &amp; Kathy<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>While we were in Montana we took the opportunity to drive over to the far west end of Fort Peck Reservoir to see if we could spot (and or hear) the male elk bugling. This is the time of year for mating and Ranger Sue told us there was a pretty big herd over that &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/09\/28\/just-a-little-burp-with-the-car-and-the-computer\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Just a Little Burp With The Car (and the computer)<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[18285,677,554707999,554707329,554707760],"tags":[554708010,554708012,307454,554708011,554708007,554708009,554708008,554708006,554707696],"class_list":["post-7894","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-equipment","category-friends","category-repair","category-traveling","category-volunteering","tag-alignment","tag-best-buy","tag-brakes","tag-computer","tag-custer","tag-exhaust","tag-muffler","tag-rapid-city","tag-south-dakota"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7894","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7894"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7894\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7911,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7894\/revisions\/7911"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7894"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7894"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7894"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}